## 30. FINAL DELIVERY REQUIREMENTS

Deliver a complete and playable Food Frenzy game, not just a design concept.

The final build must include the main menu, tutorial, kitchen gameplay, customer orders, ingredient interactions, cooking mechanics, scoring, coins, levels, upgrades, recipe collection, pause menu, settings, save system, and responsive controls.

Use original or properly licensed visual assets and sound effects.

Do not use broken image links, missing textures, empty buttons, placeholder gameplay, or decorative features that do not function.

If external assets cannot be loaded, provide appropriate local fallbacks.

Ensure the player can start the game, complete a customer order, earn rewards, finish a level, and progress to the next level without encountering a blocking issue.

Prioritize a beautiful visual presentation, satisfying food preparation, responsive controls, clear objectives, and an enjoyable gameplay loop.

The finished experience should feel like a professionally designed casual cooking game that is fun to play on both mobile devices and desktop computers.